<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Lithosaver year profits down slightly.</title>
<headline>Lithosaver year profits down slightly.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended February 28, 1997</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr pre-exeps (cts)     38.5   vs 30.5</p>
<p>    Shr after-exeps (cts)   21.9   vs 30.5</p>
<p>Final Div (cts) 6.0 making 9.5 vs 9.5</p>
<p>    Net profit after tax     6.58  vs 6.78</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			9.35  vs 10.61</p>
<p>    Tax			    2.76  vs 3.83</p>
<p>    Interest paid		6.15  vs 1.09</p>
<p>    Turnover		   254.94  vs 134.33</p>
<p>Div payable June 24 on register June 6</p>
<p>Full name: Lithosaver Systems Ltd</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
